# DOM Boundary

`@dndgem/dom` may depend on `@dndgem/core`.

It must not depend on React or `@dndgem/react`.

Deferred to later sprints (not DND-1.1):

- ResizeObserver measurement logic
- drag / resize product behaviour
- leaking raw HTMLElement types into core public contracts
